    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG Morrissey Properties offer for sale this spacious four bedroom bungalow with spacious attic conversion, enjoying fabulous countryside views of the surrounding panorama and distant sunny south side sea views. This well presented family home nestles on a 0.75 acre site, enjoying a fabulous location being within a short spin of all amenities, 11 km from Dungarvan Town Centre and all its amenities, including the Waterford Greenway. Nearby is the scenic Ring Peninsula and the picturesque seaside village of Ardmore with fabulous restaurants and beautiful beaches. The bright spacious accommodation extending to comprises, Entrance Hall, Livingroom, Kitchen/Dining/Living area, Gymnasium/playroom, 4 Bedrooms (Master Ensuite) and main Bathroom. DNG Morrissey Properties highly recommends viewing of this home.\r\n\r\nViewing Strictly by Appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor: \r\n\r\nEntrance Porch: 1.94m x 5.73m (6' 4\" x 18' 10\") \r\nThe large bright spacious hallway creates a welcoming atmosphere to the home boasting beautiful tiled flooring and convenient understairs storage area. Adding to its charm are feature recessed shelves providing an elegant display option. \r\n\r\nLiving Room: 5.02m x 5.80m (16' 6\" x 19' 0\") \r\nCharming sitting room that combines comfort and style, featuring plush carpet flooring and a striking sandstone fireplace as its centerpiece. Natural light floods the room through three impressive floor-to-ceiling windows, providing breathtaking views and creating a serene and inviting atmosphere. \r\n\r\nDining Area: 3.80m x 3.69m (12' 6\" x 12' 1\")\r\nElevated dining area with timber flooring boasting an expansive bay window that floods the space with natural light, offering a picturesque view and an inviting ambiance perfect for entertaining. \r\n\r\nDining Room: 3.52m x 4.89m (11' 7\" x 16' 1\")\r\nFeaturing elegant timber flooring and a large floor-to-ceiling window that bathes the space in natural light. Steps lead up to the open-plan kitchen, creating a seamless flow ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. \r\n\r\nKitchen: 3.88m x 4.29m (12' 9\" x 14' 1\")\r\nFeaturing tiled flooring, solid beech units paired with sleek black granite worktops, this kitchen is both stylish and durable. It comes equipped with a stove, integrated appliances and a breakfast bar providing a convenient spot for casual dining. Additional storage is provided by a convenient pantry off the kitchen. \r\n\r\nUtility Room: 1.80m x 4.18m (5' 11\" x 13' 9\")\r\n With tiled flooring, storage units and shelving. Plumbed for appliances. \r\nGuest WC: 0.90m x 1.78m (2' 11\" x 5' 10\") With tiled flooring, wash hand basin and WC. \r\n\r\nLiving Room: 4.45m x 6.63m (14' 7\" x 21' 9\")\r\nFeaturing elegant timber floors and a warm wood-burning stove. Large windows frame breathtaking panoramic views, filling the space with natural light. A patio door opens to a lovely seating area, perfect for enjoying the outdoors and extending your living space. \r\n\r\nOffice / Bedroom: 4.20m x 3.22m (13' 9\" x 10' 7\")\r\nFeaturing stylish timber flooring, this versatile room is currently used as an office/gym but is perfectly suited to serve as a comfortable downstairs bedroom. \r\n\r\nFirst Floor: \r\n\r\nLanding: 1.93m x 5.78m (6' 4\" x 19' 0\")\r\nWith carpet flooring and hot press with shelving. \r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: 5.11m x 5.84m (16' 9\" x 19' 2\")\r\nThis serene master bedroom features plush carpet flooring and a cleverly designed layout with three windows that offer stunning estuary views. The simple, bright décor creates a tranquil and airy atmosphere, making this bedroom a peaceful retreat for relaxation and rest. \r\n\r\nWalk-in wardrobe: 2.35m x 2.11m (7' 9\" x 6' 11\")\r\nProviding ample storage ensuring the space remains clutter-free, promoting a sense of tranquility and order. \r\n\r\nEn suite shower room:\r\n1.80m x 2.80m (5' 11\" x 9' 2\") \r\nThe master bedroom is complemented by a beautifully appointed ensuite, fully tiled creating a sleek and modern look. Featuring a luxurious walk-in shower unit, WC and wash hand basin. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3.73m x 4.94m (12' 3\" x 16' 2\")\r\nBright and spacious double bedroom features cosy carpet flooring, offering a warm and inviting ambiance \r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 3.60m x 3.22m (11' 10\" x 10' 7\")\r\nBright and spacious double bedroom with carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nWalk-in wardrobe: 1.13m x 1.77m (3' 8\" x 5' 10\")\r\nProviding ample storage. \r\n\r\nEn suite shower room: 2.20m x 0.88m (7' 3\" x 2' 11\")\r\nFully tiled with shower unit, wash hand basin and WC. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4: 3.41m x 3.21m (11' 2\" x 10' 6\")\r\nDouble room with carpet flooring. \r\nMain Bathroom: 2.72m x 3.02m (8' 11\" x 9' 11\") Stunning luxurious family bathroom, adorned with porcelain tiles that exudes sophistication and elegance. The centerpiece is a lavish corner bath, perfect for unwinding after a long day, with wash hand basin and WC."
      },
